From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000001 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NixOS flounder port <flounder@localhost>
Date: 2026-10-19
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: nvidia: Add support for the HTC Nexus 9 (flounder)

Add a device tree for the HTC Nexus 9 (Google, NVIDIA Tegra132,
aka "flounder"), based on the downstream HTC 3.10 device tree.

Currently supported: debug UART, eMMC, USB (xHCI host), I2C devices
(Palmas PMIC, charger, fuel gauge), SPI RMI4 touch, gpio-keys,
vibrator, extcon-USB, and a simple-framebuffer console handed over
by hboot.

Signed-off-by: NixOS flounder port <flounder@localhost>
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/Makefile	2026-10-19 12:22:40.252068213 +0800
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/Makefile	2026-10-19 12:22:40.939864688 +0800
@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@
 DTC_FLAGS_tegra264-p4071-0000+p3834-0008 := -@
 
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_TEGRA_132_SOC) += tegra132-norrin.dtb
+	dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_TEGRA_132_SOC) += tegra132-flounder.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_TEGRA_210_SOC) += tegra210-p2371-0000.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_TEGRA_210_SOC) += tegra210-p2371-2180.dtb
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_TEGRA_210_SOC) += tegra210-p2571.dtb
Only in b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia: tegra132-flounder.dts
